# Systematic Prompt Engineering

## 📌 Project Overview

This project explores how different prompt engineering techniques affect the accuracy, consistency, and reliability of Large Language Model (LLM) responses.

The experiment evaluates five prompt engineering techniques on the same set of 10 inputs, compares their performance against a baseline prompt, and applies the best-performing approach to a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) assistant.

## 🎯 Objectives

* Define a specific task and create a baseline prompt.
* Evaluate responses using accuracy and format consistency scores.
* Test five prompt engineering techniques.
* Compare average evaluation scores across prompt versions.
* Identify the technique that produces the greatest improvement.
* Design a grounding prompt for a RAG assistant.
* Test the grounding prompt against out-of-context questions.

